### ==============================================================================
### Kalaswar WhatsApp Artisan Listing Pipeline — Internal Teammate API
### Protected by shared service token: X-Service-Token or Bearer Token
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@serviceToken = kalaswar_internal_service_secret_token
@artisanPhone = +919876543210

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Ingest Product Photo (Step 1: Media Capture)
### Uploads to Cloudinary (f_auto, q_auto, background clean)
### Sets session step to 'awaiting_voice' and returns Hindi voice prompt.
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/whatsapp/media
Content-Type: application/json
X-Service-Token: {{serviceToken}}

{
  "phone": "{{artisanPhone}}",
  "media_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584100936595-c0654b55a2e2?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop",
  "caption": "हाथ से बनाया गया सूती कुशन कवर"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Ingest Voice Note (Step 2: Voice Prompt & Auto-Drafting - Complete Flow)
### Transcribes via STT (Sarvam / Whisper / Mock)
### Extracts structured attributes via LLM (title, craft, materials, colour, language)
### Computes FairPrice estimate and creates listing_drafts record
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/whatsapp/voice
Content-Type: application/json
X-Service-Token: {{serviceToken}}

{
  "phone": "{{artisanPhone}}",
  "audio_url": "https://example.com/audio/artisan_cushion_note.mp3",
  "language": "hi",
  "stt_provider": "mock"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Ingest Incomplete Voice Note (AI Honesty Rule: Missing Fields Test)
### Missing craft/material details trigger an honest clarification question instead of guessing
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/whatsapp/voice
Content-Type: application/json
X-Service-Token: {{serviceToken}}

{
  "phone": "+919876543211",
  "audio_url": "https://example.com/audio/incomplete_note.mp3",
  "language": "hi",
  "stt_provider": "mock"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Artisan Approves Draft (Step 3: Coordinator-Validation Rule Gating)
### Status transitions strictly to 'pending_validation' (needs coordinator approval to publish)
### Cloudinary dynamic GI verification watermark badge overlay is applied
### Appends immutable audit entry to action_audit_logs
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/whatsapp/approve
Content-Type: application/json
X-Service-Token: {{serviceToken}}

{
  "phone": "{{artisanPhone}}",
  "button_id": "btn_approve"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Retrieve Current Conversation Session State
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/whatsapp/session/{{artisanPhone}}
X-Service-Token: {{serviceToken}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Security Check: Request Rejected when Service Token is Missing or Invalid
### Returns 401 Unauthorized with standard error envelope
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/whatsapp/media
Content-Type: application/json
X-Service-Token: invalid_token_12345

{
  "phone": "{{artisanPhone}}",
  "media_url": "https://example.com/sample.jpg"
}
